            <description><![CDATA[<h2>VoiceClaw Realtime Companion 0.1.140</h2><ul><li>Introduces a modern dark-blue visual system aligned with the VoiceClaw Realtime iOS app and product website.</li><li>Refreshes navigation, pairing, access, task, Tailscale, update, and diagnostics surfaces with clearer hierarchy and consistent status colors.</li><li>Keeps phone-owned Voice Engine, Voice Route, model, audio, and appearance choices unchanged when importing connectivity and authentication through the Companion QR code.</li></ul>
]]></description>
